1200 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Devil King: Susanna, your actions go against the dark laws. Do you realize\this?":GOSUB 5100
1210 BM$="Susanna, though coughing violently, stared at David - no, at the Devil King\with anger.":GOSUB 5100
